      "writtenOn": "2020-10-15T22:43:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is meant to always refer to latest, not just the current latest; I\u0027ll leave the discussion for further clarification offline if that\u0027s unsatisfactory.\n\n\u0027NON_GATED\u0027 is indeed a bit confusing, but I don\u0027t have a better name choice; it refers to opting out of all the changes that are enforced globally, regardless of targetsdk, in the newest version of the platform.\n\nIdeally, there would only be *one* change id for this type of behavior, not one per platform release.",
      "parentUuid": "a1d2c6a4_3d790825",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 118,
        "startChar": 37,
        "endLine": 118,
        "endChar": 46
