      "writtenOn": "2020-10-13T09:35:20Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Since S doesn\u0027t exist in AOSP, we should probably just use R here? When you CP to internal you can use S, and then AOSP will do the right thing with no extra effort when S is later merged to AOSP.\n\nAOSP auto-merges into R QPR branches too, so doing it for S here is probably not right.\n\nhttps://android-build.googleplex.com/builds/automerger/branches says:\nmirror-aosp-master \u003d\u003e rvc-dev-plus-aosp",
